---
---
<section class="how" id="como-funciona">
  <div class="container-nx">
    <div class="how-header">
      <div class="eyebrow">Cómo funciona</div>
      <h2 class="h-section">
        Tres pasos. <em>Sin llamadas, sin esperas.</em>
      </h2>
      <p class="how-sub">
        Todo el alta es autoservicio: lo haces tú, cuando quieras, sin hablar con nadie.
        En menos de 5 minutos Lara está respondiendo por ti.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="steps">
      <div class="step">
        <div class="step-num">01</div>
        <div class="step-content">
          <h3>Te das de alta en 2 minutos</h3>
          <p>Pagas online y accedes a tu panel al momento. Sin llamada de ventas, sin esperar a que nadie te contacte.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="step-visual" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg width="100%" height="100%" viewBox="0 0 200 200" fill="none">
            <circle cx="100" cy="100" r="60" stroke="var(--nx-magnet)" stroke-width="1" stroke-dasharray="2 4" opacity="0.4"/>
            <circle cx="100" cy="100" r="40" fill="var(--nx-magnet-halo)"/>
            <path d="M70 95 Q100 75 130 95 L130 115 Q100 135 70 115 Z" fill="var(--nx-magnet)" opacity="0.9"/>
            <circle cx="85" cy="100" r="3" fill="var(--nx-void)"/>
            <circle cx="115" cy="100" r="3" fill="var(--nx-void)"/>
            <path d="M88 110 Q100 118 112 110" stroke="var(--nx-void)" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" fill="none"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="step">
        <div class="step-num">02</div>
        <div class="step-content">
          <h3>Conectas tu WhatsApp con un QR</h3>
          <p>Desde tu panel escaneas un código QR con el móvil de tu negocio, igual que en WhatsApp Web. Lo haces tú, en el momento, sin dar tu número a nadie.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="step-visual" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg width="100%" height="100%" viewBox="0 0 200 200" fill="none">
            <rect x="60" y="50" width="80" height="100" rx="12" stroke="var(--nx-magnet)" stroke-width="1.5" fill="var(--nx-deep)"/>
            <circle cx="100" cy="75" r="8" fill="var(--nx-magnet)"/>
            <rect x="75" y="90" width="50" height="4" rx="2" fill="var(--nx-line-hover)"/>
            <rect x="75" y="102" width="38" height="4" rx="2" fill="var(--nx-line-hover)"/>
            <rect x="75" y="120" width="50" height="20" rx="6" fill="var(--nx-magnet)" opacity="0.3"/>
            <path d="M80 130 L90 135 L120 122" stroke="var(--nx-magnet)" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" fill="none"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="step">
        <div class="step-num">03</div>
        <div class="step-content">
          <h3>Lara empieza a responder al instante</h3>
          <p>Desde ese mismo momento, Lara contesta por WhatsApp, Telegram y tu web las 24 horas, y agenda las citas directamente en tu calendario.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="step-visual" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg width="100%" height="100%" viewBox="0 0 200 200" fill="none">
            <rect x="45" y="55" width="110" height="90" rx="8" stroke="var(--nx-magnet)" stroke-width="1.5" fill="var(--nx-deep)"/>
            <rect x="45" y="55" width="110" height="20" rx="8" fill="var(--nx-magnet)" opacity="0.2"/>
            <rect x="60" y="85" width="20" height="20" rx="3" fill="var(--nx-magnet-halo)" stroke="var(--nx-magnet)" stroke-width="1"/>
            <rect x="90" y="85" width="20" height="20" rx="3" fill="var(--nx-magnet)" opacity="0.6"/>
            <rect x="120" y="85" width="20" height="20" rx="3" fill="var(--nx-magnet-halo)" stroke="var(--nx-magnet)" stroke-width="1"/>
            <rect x="60" y="115" width="20" height="20" rx="3" fill="var(--nx-magnet)" opacity="0.8"/>
            <rect x="90" y="115" width="20" height="20" rx="3" fill="var(--nx-magnet-halo)" stroke="var(--nx-magnet)" stroke-width="1"/>
            <rect x="120" y="115" width="20" height="20" rx="3" fill="var(--nx-magnet)" opacity="0.4"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .how { padding: 7rem 0; }
  @media (max-width: 768px) { .how { padding: 4rem 0; } }

  .how-header {
    max-width: 720px;
    margin: 0 auto 5rem;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .how-header .eyebrow { display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 1.25rem; }
  .how-sub {
    color: var(--nx-ink-muted);
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    max-width: 580px;
    margin: 1.25rem auto 0;
  }

  .steps {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  .step {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: auto 1fr auto;
    gap: 2rem;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 2.25rem;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--nx-deep), var(--nx-void));
    border: 1px solid var(--nx-line);
    border-radius: 24px;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    transition: all 0.4s var(--nx-ease);
  }
  .step::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, var(--nx-magnet-halo), transparent);
    opacity: 0;
    transition: opacity 0.4s;
  }
  .step:hover {
    border-color: rgba(78, 205, 196, 0.25);
    transform: translateX(4px);
  }
  .step:hover::before { opacity: 1; }

  .step-num {
    font-family: var(--nx-font-serif);
    font-size: 3.5rem;
    color: var(--nx-magnet);
    line-height: 1;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    font-style: italic;
    opacity: 0.85;
  }

  .step-content { position: relative; z-index: 1; }
  .step-content h3 {
    font-family: var(--nx-font-serif);
    font-size: clamp(1.35rem, 2.5vw, 1.75rem);
    font-weight: 400;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    color: var(--nx-ink);
    line-height: 1.2;
  }
  .step-content p {
    color: var(--nx-ink-muted);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
    max-width: 520px;
  }

  .step-visual {
    width: 120px;
    height: 120px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .step {
      grid-template-columns: auto 1fr;
      gap: 1.25rem;
      padding: 1.75rem;
    }
    .step-visual { display: none; }
    .step-num { font-size: 2.5rem; }
  }
</style>
